  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 8 * 1 * 4 * 2 * 16 * 2 * 8\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1) = × + × ÷ −\n\n8 * 1 * 4 * 2 * 16 * 2 * 8 ⇒ 8 = 1 × 4 + 2 × 16 ÷ 2 - 8\n\n⇒ 8 = 1 × 4 + 2 × __**16 **____**÷**____** 2**__ - 8\n\n⇒ 8 = __**1 **____**×**____** 4**__ + __**2 **____**× 8**__ - 8\n\n⇒ 8 = __**4 + 16**__ - 8\n\n⇒ 8 = __20____** - 8**__\n\n⇒ 8 ≠ 12 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) + − ÷ × × =\n\n8 * 1 * 4 * 2 * 16 * 2 * 8 ⇒ 8 + 1 - 4 ÷ 2 × 16 × 2 = 8\n\n⇒ 8 + 1 - __**4 **____**÷**____** 2**__ × 16 × 2 = 8\n\n⇒ 8 + 1 - __**2**____** × 16 ×**____** 2**__ = 8\n\n⇒ __**8 + 1**__ - 64 = 8\n\n⇒ __9** - 64**__ = 8\n\n⇒-55 ≠ 8 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) × + × − ÷ =\n\n8 * 1 * 4 * 2 * 16 * 2 * 8 ⇒ 8 × 1 + 4 × 2 - 16 ÷ 2 = 8\n\n⇒ 8 × 1 + 4 × 2 - __**16 **____**÷**____** 2**__ = 8\n\n⇒ __**8 ×**____** 1**__ + __**4 **____**×**____** 2**__ - 8 = 8\n\n⇒ __8____** + 8**__ - 8 = 8\n\n⇒ **__16__**__** - 8**__ = 8\n\n**⇒ 8 = 8 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 4) ÷ × − + × =\n\n8 * 1 * 4 * 2 * 16 * 2 * 8 ⇒ 8 ÷ 1 × 4 - 2 + 16 × 2 = 8\n\n⇒ __**8 ÷**____** 1**__ × 4 - 2 + 16 × 2 = 8\n\n⇒ __**8 ×**____** 4**__ - 2 + __**16 **____**×**____** 2**__ = 8\n\n⇒ __**32 + 32**__ - 2 = 8\n\n⇒ __64____** - 2**__ = 8\n\n⇒ 62 ≠ 8 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
